        "original_id": "64412513-f771-5693-97cd-5f804a1c22bd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Great Seal of the State of Montana\n- Places: Montana, Great Falls of the Missouri River, Missouri River\n- Topics: seal imagery, waterfalls\n\nFacts:\n- The Great Seal of the State of Montana was adopted in 1865, when Montana was a United States Territory.\n- The Great Falls of the Missouri River are a series of waterfalls on the upper Missouri River in north-central Montana in the United States.\n- The five Great Falls are located along a 10-mile segment of the Missouri River.\n- The inner circle of the Great Seal of the State of Montana depicts mountains, plains, and forests by the Great Falls on the Missouri River.",
